 deral Circuit appeals that helped to shape much of modern patent law. His 
 extraordinary contributions to the profession were further evident in his 
 numerous leadership roles within the organized bar and his decades-long te
 aching role at GW Law. Register for the Event Here\nCategory: Lectures & S
