 ates
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a book launch with Professor Francesca Bignami on 
 her new casebook\, Comparative Law: Cases\, Text\, and Materials (2026). S
 peakers will feature Professors William Dodge \, David Fontana \, Donald H
 orowitz\, Renée Lettow Lerner \, and Yvonne Tew . Associate Dean Rosa Cel
 orio will moderate the session. Lunch will be provided! This new casebook 
 offers a contemporary approach to the teaching of comparative law. By inte
 grating an up-to-date set of cases\, code texts\, and scholarly materials 
 drawn from the civil law and common law traditions\, as well as from Islam
 ic law and customary law\, it captures today’s dynamic and diverse globa
 l landscape. The book presents the basics of the civil law a\nCategory: Le
 ctures & Speakers\nOriginal listing: https://calendar.gwu.edu/event/compar
 ative-law-cases-text-materials-book-launch
